        "original_id": "e2a3a974-249d-5780-84a9-cb3e3c38c3f4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Wynn\n- Places: Las Vegas Strip, Atlantic City, Paradise Nevada, Mississippi\n- Products: Golden Nugget, Golden Nugget Atlantic City, The Mirage, Treasure Island Hotel & Casino, Bellagio, Beau Rivage, Fashion Show Mall\n- Topics: hotel and casino development, Las Vegas Strip expansion\n\nFacts:\n- Early in his career, Steve Wynn oversaw the construction and operation of the Golden Nugget, Golden Nugget Atlantic City, The Mirage, Treasure Island, the Bellagio, and Beau Rivage in Mississippi.\n- In the 1990s, Steve Wynn played a pivotal role in the resurgence and expansion of the Las Vegas Strip.\n- Treasure Island Hotel & Casino, also known as TI, is a hotel and casino on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada.\n- Treasure Island Hotel & Casino has 2,664 rooms and 220 suites.\n- Treasure Island Hotel & Casino is connected by tram to The Mirage and by pedestrian bridge to the Fashion Show Mall shopping center.",
